            "ADT^A01 (Admit / Visit Notice)",
            "MSH|^~\\&|ER_REG|GENERAL_HOSP|HIS|CORE|20261025120000||ADT^A01|MSG90101|P|2.5\nEVN|A01|20261025120000\nPID|1||MRN98214^^^HOSP||AL-FALASI^OMAR^ABDULLAH^MOHAMMED~الفلاسي^عمر^عبدالله^محمد||19880415|M|||DUBAI^UAE\nPV1|1|E|ER^BED_02^BAY_A||||9821^AL-MANSOORI^KHALID^^DR|||EMERGENCY||||||||ADM90214",
