            "ORM^O01 (General Order Message)",
            "MSH|^~\\&|EHR_CPOE|EMERGENCY|LIS_CORE|CENTRAL_LAB|20261025120500||ORM^O01|ORD9812|P|2.5\nPID|1||MRN98214^^^HOSP||AL-FALASI^OMAR\nORC|NW|ORD-2026-01|||||^^^STAT||20261025120500|9821^AL-MANSOORI\nOBR|1|ORD-2026-01||49563-0^Cardiac Troponin I^LN|||20261025120500|||||||||9821^AL-MANSOORI",
            "ServiceRequest (Lab Order)",
            """
{
  "resourceType": "ServiceRequest",
  "id": "req-cardiac-01",
  "status": "active",
  "intent": "order",
